Installation instructions:

Ok, I'm kinda bad at writing these things so stick with me here..


1)  Put the AD.Rexx file in your Pfiles: directory (or anywhere else you want
    it to go realy)

2)  Make a directory called CNet:ads OR edit line 47 in the AD.Rexx file.
    the one that looks like this:

     path1 = 'cnet:ads/' /* <= put your ad path in here */

3)  add the following line to your SYSTEXT:sys.welcome file:

    #0 Pfiles:Ad.rexx}

4)  Now, create the text ads and name them ad.1 ad.2 etc.

    I use the Amigados FILENOTE command to keep track of what ad is what. I.e.

    ad.1       532  ----rwed  Today 12:32:45  : An ad for cow grooming kits.
    ad.2       321  ----rwed  Today 12:55:21  : An ad for Mary's House o' fun

5)  Change line #51  in the AD.rexx file to the number of ads that you
    have in the cnet:ads directory.

    noa = 3
          ^
          ^change this value to the # of ads that you have on-line.

6) Get an envelope
7) write:

         Leo Anderson
         P.O. box 56
         Laporte, Mn
         56461 

   On the front of it.

8) insert $10 check, cash, or money order into the envelope.

9) attach postage

10) drop into mailbox

11) enjoy. 

